OL,3,GNEWSA'Steam is testament to how our
OL,4,Aregion led the way'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo metro train drivers who put in
OL,7,Fvoluntary shifts shovelling coal on a
OL,8,Fsteam railway have said the historic
OL,9,Fengineering is a "testament to how our
OL,10,Fregion led the way".
OL,12,FMichael Darling, from Monkseaton, and
OL,13,FRob Kitching, from Durham, who usually
OL,14,Fhelp run the Tyne and Wear Metro, also
OL,15,Fvolunteer for the Stephenson Steam
OL,16,FRailway Museum in North Tyneside.
OL,18,FThe pair, who are both qualified steam
OL,19,Fengine drivers, drive the museum's only
OL,20,Fworking engine - the Ashington Number 5
OL,21,F- on a two mile (3.2km) stretch of line
OL,22,Fat Percy Main in North Shields.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
