OL,3,GNEWSA'Steam is testament to how our
OL,4,Aregion led the way'
OL,5,
OL,6,FKitching said: "They are part of the
OL,7,Fheritage of the North East, and are
OL,8,Ftestament to how our region led the way
OL,9,Fwith this technology."
